<title>HONG KONG: HK and Shanghai shares suspended.</title>
<headline>HK and Shanghai shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Hong Kong and Shanghai Hotels Ltd were suspended at the company's request ahead of the start of the afternoon session pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
